0/80 font-serif\">Happy Birthday,</p><h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 leading-tight\"><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-500 via-pink-600 to-purple-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent drop-shadow-xs\">Vamsha</span><span class=\"inline-block ml-2 sm:ml-3 animate-bounce\">🎉</span></h1></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 my-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.85)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-100/90 border border-amber-200/80 text-amber-900 font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-amber-600\">Turning</span><span class=\"text-amber-800 font-bold\">24</span><span>✨</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-purple-100/80 border border-purple-200/80 text-purple-900 font-medium text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-xs\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart w-3.5 h-3.5 text-rose-500 fill-rose-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5\"></path></svg><span>February 21</span></div></div><p class=\"text-neutral-600 text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed my-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(15px)\">Today is all about celebrating the wonderful human you are. Another year more radiant, incredible, and genuinely unforgettable.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3.5 w-full mt-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><button class=\"w-full sm:w-auto flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-500 via-pink-500 to-rose-600 text-white font-semibold text-base