22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span>Tap for Sparkles ✨</span></button></div><div class=\"mt-12 flex items-center justify-center gap-6 text-rose-300/80\"><span class=\"text-2xl animate-bounce\" style=\"animation-duration:2.4s\">🎂</span><span class=\"text-xl animate-bounce\" style=\"animation-duration:2.8s;animation-delay:0.2s\">🎁</span><span class=\"text-2xl animate-bounce\" style=\"animation-duration:2.2s;animation-delay:0.4s\">💖</span><span class=\"text-xl animate-bounce\" style=\"animation-duration:3.0s;animation-delay:0.1s\">✨</span><span class=\"text-2xl animate-bounce\" style=\"animation-duration:2.6s;animation-delay:0.3s\">🥂</span></div></div></section><section id=\"cake-section\" class=\"relative min-h-[95vh] flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 py-16 text-center\"><div class=\"max-w-lg w-full mx-auto flex flex-col items-center\"><div class=\"space-y-2 mb-8\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-100/90 border border-amber-200/80 text-amber-800 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span>Interactive Birthday Cake</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-neutral-800 font-serif\">Make a Birthday Wish</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-600 te