cking-widest uppercase\">✨ Happy Birthday <!-- -->Vamsha<!-- --> ✨</div><div class=\"w-full flex justify-around px-2 pb-1\"><div class=\"w-4 h-2 bg-white/80 rounded-b-full\"></div><div class=\"w-5 h-3 bg-white/80 rounded-b-full\"></div><div class=\"w-3 h-2 bg-white/80 rounded-b-full\"></div><div class=\"w-5 h-3.5 bg-white/80 rounded-b-full\"></div><div class=\"w-4 h-2 bg-white/80 rounded-b-full\"></div></div></div><div class=\"relative w-76 h-5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-200 via-amber-300 to-yellow-200 rounded-full shadow-xl border-b-2 border-amber-400/80 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"w-20 h-2 bg-amber-400/70 rounded-b-lg -mb-4 shadow-md\"></div></div></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-500 italic max-w-xs mt-4\">“<!-- -->Close your eyes, take a deep breath, and make your biggest wish...<!-- -->”</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-3 mt-6 w-full max-w-sm\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-3.5 px-6 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 to-orange-400 text-white font-semibold text-sm shadow-lg shadow-amber-200/50 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wind w-4 h-4 animate-pulse\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.8 19.6A2 2 0 1 0 14 16H2\"></path><path d=\"M17.5 8a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 2 4H2\"></path><path d=\"M9.8 4.4A2 2 0 1 1 11 8H2\"></path></svg><span>Blow All Candles at Once 🎂💨</span></button></div></div></section><section id=\"scratch-section\" class=\"relative min-h-[95vh] flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 py-16 text-center\"><div class=\"max-w-md w-full mx-auto flex flex-col items-center\"><div class=\"space-y-2 mb-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-pink-100/90 border border-pink-200/80 text-pink-800 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles w-3.5 h-3.5 text-pink-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span>Mystery Scratch Card</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-neutral-800 font-serif\">Unwrap a Golden Memory</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-600 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-sm mx-auto\">Swipe your finger or mouse over the glitter card to reveal a special keepsake!</p></div><div class=\"w-full max-w-xs flex items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4 text-xs font-medium text-neutral-500\"><span>Reveal Progress:</span><div class=\"flex-1 h-2.5 bg-neutral-200/80 rounded-full overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-400 to-rose-500 transition-all duration-200 rounded-full\" style=\"width:0%\"></div></div><span class=\"w-8 text-right font-bold text-rose-600\">0<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[340px] aspect-[4/5] rounded-3xl p-3 bg-white shadow-2xl shadow-rose-200/50 border border-rose-100/80 select-none overflow-hidden touch-none\"><div class=\"w-full h-full rounded-2xl bg-[#FCFAF7] border border-neutral-100 p-3.5 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-inner\"><div class=\"relative w-full aspect-square rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-200/80 shadow-xs group\"><img alt=\"Birthday memory\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 340px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsample-memory.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsample-memory.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsample-memory.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsample-memory.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsample-memory.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsample-memory.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsample-memory.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsample-memory.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsample-memory.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-xs text-white text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wide\">Unforgettable Moments</div></div><div class=\"text-left mt-3 space-y-1\"><h3 class=\"font-serif font-bold text-neutral-800 text-base leading-tight\">The Joy You Bring to Life ❤️</h3><p class=\"text-neutral-600 text-xs leading-relaxed font-sans line-clamp-3\">From spontaneous late-night laughs to the quiet moments when you simply made everything brighter — having you in our lives is the greatest blessing.</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-2 border-t border-neutral-200/60 mt-2\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-serif italic text-neutral-400\">Treasured forever in our hearts</span><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold transition-all bg-rose-50 text-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-100\" title=\"Send love\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" 