n></button></div></div></section><section id=\"slot-section\" class=\"relative min-h-[95vh] flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 py-16 text-center\"><div class=\"max-w-lg w-full mx-auto flex flex-col items-center\"><div class=\"space-y-2 mb-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-purple-100/90 border border-purple-200/80 text-purple-800 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-dices w-3.5 h-3.5 text-purple-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"12\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"10\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m17.92 14 3.5-3.5a2.24 2.24 0 0 0 0-3l-5-4.92a2.24 2.24 0 0 0-3 0L10 6\"></path><path d=\"M6 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M10 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M15 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M18 9h.01\"></path></svg><span>Interactive Game</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-neutral-800 font-serif\">Birthday Vibe Machine</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-600 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-sm mx-auto\">Spin the reels to discover funny inside jokes, sweet compliments, and epic memories!</p></div><div class=\"relative w-full max-w-md bg-gradient-to-b from-purple-900 via-indigo-950 to-neutral-900 rounded-[2.5rem] p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-2xl border-4 border-amber-300/80 my-4 text-white\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 rounded-2xl bg-amber-400 text-neutral-950 font-extrabold text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-wider uppercase mb-4 shadow-inner\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles w-4 h-4 text-amber-900 animate-spin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg>LUCKY VIBE 777</span><div class=\"flex gap-1\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-red-600 animate-ping\"></span><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500 animate-pulse\"></span><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-500 animate-bounce\"></span></div></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"relative rounded-2xl bg-neutral-900/90 border border-purple-400/40 p-3.5 overflow-hidden shadow-inner text-left\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-pink-300 tracking-wider uppercase mb-1 flex items-center justify-between\"><span>Funny Quirk 😜</span><span class=\"text-pink-400/60 font-mono\">#01</span></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-pink-50 min-h-[38px] flex items-center\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none\">Forever 5 mins late with iced coffee in hand ☕</p></div><div class=\"relative rounded-2xl bg-neutral-900/90 border border-amber-400/40 p-3.5 overflow-hidden shadow-inner text-left\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-300 tracking-wider uppercase mb-1 flex items-center justify-between\"><span>Pure Vibe ✨</span><span class=\"text-amber-400/60 font-mono\">#02</span></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-amber-50 min-h-[38px] flex items-center\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none\">Lights up every room effortlessly ✨</p></div><div class=\"relative rounded-2xl bg-neutral-900/90 border border-teal-400/40 p-3.5 overflow-hidden shadow-inner text-left\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-teal-300 tracking-wider uppercase mb-1 flex items-center justify-between\"><span>Core Memory 🌟</span><span class=\"text-teal-400/60 font-mono\">#03</span></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-teal-50 min-h-[38px] flex items-center\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none\">That legendary road trip under the starry sky 🌌</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-3\"><button class=\"w-full py-4 px-6 rounded-2xl font-extrabold text-base uppercase tracking-wider shadow-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 via-yellow-400 to-amber-500 text-neutral-950 hover:brightness-110 active:scale-95 shadow-amber-500/30\">🎰 PULL LEVER / SPIN 🎰</button></div></div></div></section><section id=\"letter-section\" class=\"relative min-h-[95vh] flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 py-16 text-center\"><div class=\"max-w-xl w-full mx-auto flex flex-col items-center\"><div class=\"space-y-2 mb-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-rose-100/90 border border-rose-200/80 text-rose-800 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail w-3.5 h-3.5 text-rose-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><span>Heartfelt Letter</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-neutral-800 font-serif\">A Heartfelt Letter For You</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-600 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-sm mx-auto\">Tap the wax seal to unlock your personal birthday note.</p></div><div class=\"relative w-full max-w-lg my-4 flex flex-col items-center select-none\"><div class=\"relative w-full max-w-sm aspect-[16/11] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-100 via-pink-50 to-rose-200 p-1 shadow-2xl bord